---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { NEW_ISSUE, ISSUES } from '../lib/links';
---
<Base title="Support" description="Get help with Shotlight: report a bug, suggest an idea, or find answers to common questions.">
  <div class="wrap page">
    <header class="head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Support</span>
      <h1>How can we help?</h1>
      <p class="lede">Shotlight is made by one person. Bugs and ideas are tracked in the open on GitHub, where you can follow what happens to them.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="cards">
      <a class="card" href={NEW_ISSUE} data-track="support_report_bug">
        <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B3321F" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v6M12 17h.01"></path></svg></span>
        <b>Report a bug</b>
        <span>Something doesn’t work as it should. Tell us what happened and how to make it happen again.</span>
        <span class="go">Open an issue →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href={NEW_ISSUE} data-track="support_suggest_idea">
        <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#4D6B00" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 18h6M10 21h4M12 3a6 6 0 0 0-3.5 10.9c.6.5 1 1.2 1 2.1h5c0-.9.4-1.6 1-2.1A6 6 0 0 0 12 3z"></path></svg></span>
        <b>Suggest an idea</b>
        <span>Something you’d like Shotlight to do. The situation is more useful than the solution.</span>
        <span class="go">Share an idea →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/#faq" data-track="support_faq">
        <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1F5E99" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 3.5 2.3c-.6.3-1 .9-1 1.6V14M12 17h.01"></path></svg></span>
        <b>Read the FAQ</b>
        <span>Finding screenshots, naming, privacy, which Macs it runs on.</span>
        <span class="go">Questions people ask →</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="prose tips">
      <h2>Before you report a bug</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Which version?</strong> In Finder, select Shotlight in Applications and press ⌘I. Make sure you have the <a href="/download">latest version</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Can’t open the app?</strong> That’s macOS asking you to confirm an app that isn’t signed by Apple yet. Follow the <a href="/download#first-open">first-open steps</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Attaching a screenshot?</strong> Issues are public. Blur passwords, keys, codes and anything personal first.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You can also look through <a href={ISSUES}>existing issues</a>: someone may have reported it already.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .page { max-width: 1000px; padding-top: 80px; padding-bottom: 96px; }
  .head { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 40px; max-width: 700px; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(36px, 4.5vw, 56px); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -0.04em; font-weight: 600; }
  .cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
  .card {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding: 24px; border-radius: 20px; background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--text); text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 120ms ease-out, transform 120ms ease-out;
  }
  .card:hover { border-color: var(--line-strong); color: var(--text); transform: translateY(-2px); }
  .card:active { transform: scale(0.99); }
  .card b { font-size: 18px; }
  .card > span:not(.icon):not(.go) { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--text-2); }
  .icon { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--surface-2); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
  .go { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 6px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--beam-ink); font-weight: 500; }
  .tips { margin-top: 56px; max-width: 760px; }
  .tips h2 { margin-top: 0; }
  @media (max-width: 640px) { .page { padding-top: 48px; padding-bottom: 72px; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .card, .card:hover, .card:active { transition: none; transform: none; } }
</style>
